Subject: [PATCH] Allocate unused managed GMod textures only on GPU use

Co-Authored-By: Codex (gpt-6.1-sol) <noreply@openai.com>
---
 src/d3d9/d3d9_common_texture.cpp           | 38 +++++++++-
 src/d3d9/d3d9_common_texture.h             | 17 ++++-
